# OpenVPN Client Configuration Profile (Practical 15)
client
dev tun
proto udp
remote 192.168.1.10 1194
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun

ca ca.crt
cert client1.crt
key client1.key
tls-auth ta.key 1

data-ciphers AES-256-GCM:AES-128-GCM:CHACHA20-POLY1305
cipher AES-256-GCM
auth SHA256
verb 3
